# Pinned release of the test bot (https://github.com/Mumcord/mumbot), used by the E2E and smoke
# tests. scripts/fetch-mumbot.sh downloads it and checks these hashes (from the release's
# SHA256SUMS). Bump all lines together; crates/engine/Cargo.toml pins the same tag for the live
# engine tests.
